<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32444" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏlĕārĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to oil</i>, <i>oil-</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cella vinaria, olearia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 3</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cic. Sen. 16, 56</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dolia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 8, 8, § 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mercatores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					50, 4, 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏlĕārĭus</span></b> ,
				ii, m., <i>an
			oilgrinder</i> or <i>oil-seller</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in velabro olearii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Capt. 3, 1, 29</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">diligentes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col. 12, 50, 13</span></i>
			.</div>
